  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHq/975",
  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p>김향미 선생님이 하신 화학변화 모형으로&nbsp;나타내기를 해 보았습니다.</p><p>예시 작품 2개쯤 보여주고 알아서 다양한 분자 모형을 준비해 오라고 했습니다.</p><p>그랬더니 미니블럭, 먹다 남은&nbsp;알약, 과자, 뽕뽕이, 이쑤시개, 동전, 단추&nbsp;등 다양한 분자모형을 준비해 왔네요.</p><p>가장 간단한 분자모형 준비물이 스티커 였어요.</p><p>화합, 분해, 치환, 복분해의 뜻. 예 2개이상, 모형으로 창의적으로 나타내기가 평가 기준입니다.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999B03505CBE9A4819\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190422_122312.jpg\"  id=\"A_999B03505CBE9A48192AC2\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E855505CBE9A4921\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190422_103853.jpg\"  id=\"A_99E855505CBE9A49211778\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994493505CBE9A4A27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190422_104014.jpg\"  id=\"A_994493505CBE9A4A272397\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9944BC505CBE9A4A26\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190422_104026.jpg\"  id=\"A_9944BC505CBE9A4A263242\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9933F3505CBE9A4B1E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190410_142030.jpg\"  id=\"A_9933F3505CBE9A4B1EA30B\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994756505CBE9A4C27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190410_142036.jpg\"  id=\"A_994756505CBE9A4C271DC9\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C9D3505CBE9A4D22\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190410_142041.jpg\"  id=\"A_99C9D3505CBE9A4D228E4E\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996637485CBE9A4D1A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20190410_142045.jpg\"  id=\"A_996637485CBE9A4D1AFF65\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
